## 6. Main Code 2: `predict.py`

This program loads the saved model and predicts whether a tower may experience hardware failure.

```python
import joblib
import pandas as pd

model = joblib.load("telecom_tower_model.pkl")

new_data = pd.DataFrame({
    "temperature_c": [55],
    "battery_health": [62],
    "Power_Consumption_W": [2500],
    "signal_drop_rate": [52],
    "Fan_Speed_RPM": [3000],
    "Humidity_Percent": [60],
    "Traffic_Load": [3500],
    "Tower_Age_Years": [8]
})

prediction = model.predict(new_data)

if prediction[0] == 1:
    print("Hardware Failure Predicted")
else:
    print("Tower is Healthy")
```

